@MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012
@accessToken = paste-token-from-login-response-here

### Get a development access token
POST {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Reader token (can read regions, cannot add regions)
POST {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reader",
  "password": "reader-password"
}

### Editor token (can read and add regions)
POST {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "editor",
  "password": "editor-password"
}

### Get regions with the JWT access token
GET {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Region/regions
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add a region (requires Editor or Admin role)
POST {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Region/regions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Region 4",
  "code": "R4"
}

### Get weather with the JWT access token
GET {{MyRefresherWebAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
